# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Provenance-critical research data: store byte-exact, never newline-convert.
#
# Every path below has a SHA-256 recorded in a checksum.sha256 or a *manifest*.json.
# With core.autocrlf=true (Git for Windows default) an unmarked text file is
# committed as LF and checked out as CRLF, which rewrites *every* LF in the file --
# including newlines embedded inside quoted CSV fields. That silently breaks the
# recorded-hash audit chain even though no content was edited.
#
# Diagnosis and recovery record: research/logs/reproducibility_diagnosis_20260720.md
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/curated_v2/**                        -text
data/interim/**                           -text
research/searches/**                      -text
research/fulltext/**                       -text
research/synthesis/**                     -text

# Derived build outputs, regenerated by `npm run prepare:knowledge`. These are
# written with Path.write_text(), which emits CRLF on Windows and LF elsewhere,
# so pinning them byte-exact makes the rebuild-determinism check in
# validate_ai_exploratory_bundle.py fail on whichever platform did not produce
# the committed copy. They hold no raw-source provenance -- only the inputs
# above do -- so let git normalise them as before.
data/curated_v2/*.jsonl                   text

# pre-existing rules
research/systematic_review_v3/*.csv -text
research/validation/*.json text eol=lf

# v4.0 (MECIR search redesign) provenance-critical paths. Same rule and same
# reason as the v2.1 block above: these files have SHA-256 recorded in
# research/logs/v40_run_report.json, research/screening/v40_agent/batch_index.json
# and research/searches_v4/*/pubmed/*/checksum.sha256. Newline conversion on
# checkout rewrites LF inside quoted CSV abstract fields and breaks those hashes.
data/curated_v4/**                        -text
research/searches_v4/**                   -text
research/screening/v40_agent/**           -text
research/systematic_review_v40/**         -text

# 아래 세 경로는 v40_run_report.json 이 SHA-256 을 기록한다
# (phase_e.decisions_log / protocol.amendments_sha256 / protocol.sha256).
# 개행 변환이 일어나면 새 클론에서 기록 해시와 어긋난다.
research/logs/DECISIONS_v40.md             -text
research/logs/v40_run_report.json          -text
research/logs/v40_local_only_manifest.json -text
research/logs/v40_phase_b_verification.json -text
research/protocol/protocol-v4.0-mecir-search.md -text
research/protocol/amendments.csv           -text
research/logs/v40_delivery_receipt.json -text
